---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

// Cookies actually used by the site (for the table in section 6)
const cookieList = [
  { nome: 'vamdeco-cc', forn: 'VAM Deco (this site)', fin: 'Stores your cookie choices, so we do not ask for consent on every visit.', dur: 'Permanent (until you delete it)', cat: 'Necessary' },
  { nome: '_ga', forn: 'Google Analytics', fin: 'Distinguishes visitors anonymously for traffic statistics.', dur: '2 years', cat: 'Statistics' },
  { nome: '_ga_PNS7X8SYV6', forn: 'Google Analytics', fin: 'Keeps the session state for the anonymous visit count.', dur: '2 years', cat: 'Statistics' },
  { nome: '_gid', forn: 'Google Analytics', fin: 'Distinguishes visitors within the day, anonymously.', dur: '24 hours', cat: 'Statistics' },
];
---
<Base
  title="Privacy and cookie policy | VAM Deco"
  description="VAM Deco Agency Sagl's privacy and cookie policy, Sementina (Ticino): what data we collect, why, who we share it with and your rights."
  i18n
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-16 pb-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-brand font-display text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
      <span class="h-px w-8 bg-brand" aria-hidden="true"></span>Privacy
    </span>
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-4">Privacy and cookie policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-carta/50">VAM Deco Agency Sagl · Via Pobbia 4D, 6514 Sementina (Ticino) · Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <p class="mt-8 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">Your privacy matters to us. This page clearly explains what data we collect when you visit our website or send us a request, why we use it, who we share it with and what your rights are. This document is drafted in compliance with the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP, SR 235.1) and, for visitors from the European Union, with EU Regulation 2016/679 (GDPR).</p>

    <!-- 1 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">1. Data controller</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">The data controller is <strong class="text-carta">VAM Deco Agency Sagl</strong>, Via Pobbia 4D, 6514 Sementina (Ticino), Switzerland. For any privacy question you can write to us at <a href="mailto:info@vamdeco.ch" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">info@vamdeco.ch</a> or call us on <a href="tel:+41765889497" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">+41 76 588 94 97</a>.</p>

    <!-- 2 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">2. What data we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">Depending on how you interact with us, we may collect:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Contact details:</strong> first name, surname, email, phone number and, if you provide it, your company.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Information you provide voluntarily:</strong> the details you enter in the contact forms, quote requests and the message field.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Browsing data:</strong> IP address, device and browser type, pages visited and time spent, collected anonymously via Google Analytics and only if you accept statistics cookies.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Payment data:</strong> if you make a purchase, the transaction data is handled directly by secure payment providers. We do not store full card numbers.</span></li>
    </ul>

    <!-- 3 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">3. Why we use your data</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>To respond to your requests and prepare quotes and proposals.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>To provide the services you request, such as the personalisation of products and projects.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>To contact you by email, phone or message regarding your request.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>To understand how the site is used and improve it, anonymously and only with your consent.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>To send you promotional communications, only if you give us explicit consent.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>To fulfil legal and tax obligations.</span></li>
    </ul>

    <!-- 4 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">4. Legal basis</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">We process your data on the basis of <strong class="text-carta">your consent</strong> (for example for statistics and marketing cookies), to follow up on your request (pre-contractual measures) and to fulfil our legal obligations. Providing your data is optional: without the essential information, however, we cannot handle your request. You can withdraw your consent at any time.</p>

    <!-- 5 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">5. Who we share data with</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">We do not sell or trade your data. We only share it with those who help us provide the service, and only as far as necessary:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Payment service providers, to process transactions securely.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Google Analytics, for anonymous visit statistics, active only if you accept statistics cookies.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Advertising platforms (for example Google Ads or Meta), only if you accept marketing cookies.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Competent authorities, if required by law.</span></li>
    </ul>

    <!-- 6 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">6. Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">Cookies are small files saved on your device that let the site work and remember your choices. On your first visit we show you a banner: you can accept all cookies or open <strong class="text-carta">Customise</strong> to choose category by category. Statistics and marketing cookies are activated <strong class="text-carta">only after your consent</strong>. If you decline, no cookies are set and we do not send data that identifies you: Google may receive at most anonymous, aggregated signals, without cookies (Consent Mode), used only for statistical estimates.</p>

    <p class="mt-5 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">We use four categories of cookies:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Necessary:</strong> always on. They enable the security and basic functions of the site, including remembering your cookie choices.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Preferences:</strong> store your settings for a personalised experience.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Statistics:</strong> help us understand how the site is used, anonymously (Google Analytics).</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span><strong class="text-carta">Marketing:</strong> used to show you offers and ads relevant to your interests.</span></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm border-collapse">
        <thead class="bg-white/5 text-carta/60">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Cookie</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Provider</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Purpose</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Duration</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Category</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/10">
          {cookieList.map((c) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-carta font-medium whitespace-nowrap">{c.nome}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-carta/70 whitespace-nowrap">{c.forn}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-carta/70 min-w-[16rem]">{c.fin}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-carta/70 whitespace-nowrap">{c.dur}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-carta/70 whitespace-nowrap">{c.cat}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-carta/45 leading-relaxed">Marketing cookies are set by the advertising platforms only if you enable the "Marketing" category, and only during any active campaigns. You can also block or delete cookies from your browser settings.</p>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl card-scura p-6">
      <p class="text-sm text-carta/75">Want to review your cookie choices? Reopen the panel with the <button type="button" id="apri-cookie-da-privacy" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">Cookie settings</button> button.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 7 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">7. How long we keep your data</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">We keep your data only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described and to comply with legal obligations (for example accounting ones). When no longer needed, it is securely deleted or anonymised.</p>

    <!-- 8 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">8. Your rights</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">At any time you can:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Access your data and request a copy of it.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Rectify or update inaccurate data.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Request the deletion of your data, subject to legal retention obligations.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Restrict or object to processing and request data portability.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Withdraw a consent already given at any time.</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">To exercise these rights, write to us at <a href="mailto:info@vamdeco.ch" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">info@vamdeco.ch</a>. You also have the right to contact the competent supervisory authority (in Switzerland, the Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner, FDPIC).</p>

    <!-- 9 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">9. Data security</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">We take appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your data from unauthorised access, alteration or loss. The site runs entirely over an encrypted connection (HTTPS).</p>

    <!-- 10 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">10. Transfer of data abroad</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">Some providers we use (such as Google) may also process data outside Switzerland and the European Union. In these cases the transfer takes place with appropriate safeguards provided for by law, such as standard contractual clauses.</p>

    <!-- 11 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">11. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">We may update this policy over time. The valid version is always the one published on this page, with the last updated date shown at the top. We invite you to check it periodically.</p>

    <!-- 12 -->
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-1 text-brand">12. Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed">For any question about this policy or the processing of your data:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>VAM Deco Agency Sagl, Via Pobbia 4D, 6514 Sementina (Ticino), Switzerland</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Email: <a href="mailto:info@vamdeco.ch" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">info@vamdeco.ch</a></span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Phone: <a href="tel:+41765889497" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">+41 76 588 94 97</a></span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-carta/75 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-brand shrink-0 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span>Website: <a href="https://vamdeco.ch" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">vamdeco.ch</a></span></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
  <script>
    document.getElementById('apri-cookie-da-privacy')?.addEventListener('click', () => (window as any).vamCookie?.apri());
  </script>
</Base>
